  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting the Illegal Trade of Jaguars, Parrots, and Primates in Peru by Strengthening Capacities to Control the Sale of Parts From Illegally Sourced Wildlife and Addressing Demand Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO COUNTER WILDLIFE TRAFFICKING (CWT) IN PERU BY CONTROLLING THE SALE OF HANDICRAFTS MADE WITH PARTS FROM ILLEGALLY SOURCED ANIMALS, AND STRENGTHENING CAPACITIESIN THE HANDLING AND MANAGEMENT OF SEIZED LIVE SPECIMENS RESULTING FROM STRONGER CWT ENFORCEMENT.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
